^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Round-to-integral (rintf, rint) under all rounding modes, with coverage
of special values (NaN, ±Inf, ±0), denormals, negative ties,
already-integral inputs that hit the exp_ge_f early-out, and a format with a
narrow exponent.
